Create a page titled "Northstar Services".
Create a header named "site-header".
Create a navigation bar with Home, About, Services and Contact links inside "site-header".
Make the navigation bar adapt to smaller screens.
Create a main named "content".
Create a hero section with a heading "Build what comes next", a description "Practical technology services for growing teams." and a button "Explore services" inside "content".
Create a link labelled "View our services" to "/services" inside the hero.
Create three cards for Web Development, AI and Cloud Computing.
Each card should have a short description "Talk to our team about your project." and a button "Learn more".
Put all the cards inside one container.
Put the container inside "content".
Display three cards in a row on desktop.
Stack the cards vertically on mobile.
Make the cards equal in height and align them neatly.
Give all cards rounded corners, a subtle border and consistent spacing.
Add a subtle shadow to each card.
Create a footer named "site-footer".
Add a paragraph that says "Northstar Services. Built with care." inside "site-footer".
Use a clean, modern design with readable typography.
Use a blue primary color and a light-grey background.
Make the layout responsive on mobile devices.
